    {
      "id": "c13",
      "chapter": "Ch3 Count: why it worked",
      "file": "vo/ep3/c13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 30.7,
      "leadFrames": 6,
      "frames": 939,
      "startFrame": 7563,
      "narration": "Here's why. <short pause> Giving a box early is really a pass. You take the box, then you have to draw. <short pause> So the safe lines run out on your turn, not his. <short pause> When they do, he gives a short chain. <short pause> And you're the one who opens the long one. <short pause> Play safe there, and it ends five–four. <short pause> Give the box, and it's six–three. <short pause> One box, given early. Worth three at the end.",
      "estimated": true,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Here's why.",
          "start": 0.15,
          "end": 1.16
        },
        {
          "text": "Giving a box early is really a pass.",
          "start": 1.16,
          "end": 4.465
        },
        {
          "text": "You take the box, then you have to draw.",
          "start": 4.465,
          "end": 8.138
        },
        {
          "text": "So the safe lines run out on your turn, not his.",
          "start": 8.138,
          "end": 12.545
        },
        {
          "text": "When they do, he gives a short chain.",
          "start": 12.545,
          "end": 15.943
        },
        {
          "text": "And you're the one who opens the long one.",
          "start": 15.943,
          "end": 19.799
        },
        {
          "text": "Play safe there, and it ends five–four.",
          "start": 19.799,
          "end": 23.38
        },
        {
          "text": "Give the box, and it's six–three.",
          "start": 23.38,
          "end": 26.41
        },
        {
          "text": "One box, given early.",
          "start": 26.41,
          "end": 28.338
        },
        {
          "text": "Worth three at the end.",
          "start": 28.338,
          "end": 30.45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
